ine/godot/pull/118318.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-08T22:02:56Z"},"body":"I caught these errors when testing the MRP from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118278. \r\n\r\n1. Compile error when using TIME in a custom function. The problem here is just that `time` was defined below where the custom functions are defined. The solution is just to move it up\r\n2. HALF_RES_COLOR and QUARTER_RES_COLOR lead to compile errors since they are copy-pasted from the vulkan backend. The compatibility renderer doesn't support half or quarter res rendering right now. So they don't do anything, but the shader shouldn't fail with an internal compile error. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118318/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118318/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}